{"product_id":"karens-witch-baby-sitters-little-sister-graphix","title":"Karen's Witch (Baby-Sitters Little Sister Graphix)","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fresh and fun graphic novel series spin-off of The Baby-sitters Club, featuring Kristy's little stepsister!Karen Brewer lives next door to Mrs. Porter, who wears long robes and has wild gray hair. Mrs. Porter has a black cat named Midnight and always seems to be working in her garden. Karen isn't supposed to spy on her neighbor, but she's determined to prove that Mrs. Porter is a witch named Morbidda Destiny!Mrs. Porter is getting ready to have a special meeting at her house, and Karen is sure the meeting is for witches. Are they going to cast a spell on Karen? Or will she be brave enough to send them away -- once and for all?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Katy Farina\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781338315196\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 144\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45706838999193,"sku":"16RB-2-,15RA-29781338315196","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68c0fe3c0653b_Karen_s_Witch__Baby-Sitters_Little_Sister_Graphix__Katy_Farina.jpg?v=1757499417","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/karens-witch-baby-sitters-little-sister-graphix","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}